    eyebrow="Worth paying more for"
    heading="KROSER Laptop Briefcase (Up to 17.3”)"
    intro="Carrying a laptop in a flimsy bag is a good way to break expensive gear."
    productName="KROSER Laptop Briefcase (Up to 17.3”)"
    imageUrl="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912zP+qy8IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg"
    imageAlt="KROSER Laptop Briefcase (Up to 17.3”)"
    imageSourceLabel="Amazon"
    imageSourceUrl="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M5N8X11?tag=deskrespawn-20"
    productMeta="Amazon ASIN B07M5N8X11"
    tags={['Budget tech','Worth paying more for']}
    why="Carrying a laptop in a flimsy bag is a good way to break expensive gear."
    tradeoff="This one is built to actually protect it. I use it for travel and daily carry. It has enough space for a large laptop and accessories without feeling cheap or overstuffed."
    check="Confirm current price and availability before purchase. Product was imported from a short editorial blurb; specs and compatibility have not been individually re-verified."
    facts="Sourced from taurustech.me/affiliate. See the retailer page for the current spec sheet."
